Z||000008||DaRkLoRD||03-26-2001||03:53 PM||||If I was going to be towing a car, I'd probably want to use my own dolly design.. it's more like a trailer that's just 2 axles attached together though.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>but it's adjustable!<P>(I just designed this in my head btw)<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
